      "source": "Create a <a href=\"TypedValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.expression\"><code>TypedValue</code></a> for a particular value with a particular\n<a href=\"../core/convert/TypeDescriptor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>TypeDescriptor</code></a> which may contain additional generic declarations.",
      "translation": "为具有特定<a href=\"../core/convert/TypeDescriptor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>TypeDescriptor</code></a>（可能包含额外的泛型声明）的特定值创建一个<code>TypedValue</code><a href=\"TypedValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.expression\"></a>。",
      "count": 3
