      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"TypedValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.expression\"><code>TypedValue</code></a> for a simple object. The <a href=\"../core/convert/TypeDescriptor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>TypeDescriptor</code></a>\nis inferred from the object, so no generic declarations are preserved.",
      "translation": "为简单对象创建一个<a href=\"TypedValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.expression\"><code>TypedValue</code></a>。<a href=\"../core/convert/TypeDescriptor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>TypeDescriptor</code></a>是从对象推断得出的，因此不保留泛型声明。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
